Z||000005||FIEROCIOUS||11-06-2000||01:35 PM||||Hey Zorba, I used .1O wire I don't have AC so I ran the wire through PVC pipe (grey conduit type) and used the exsisting hangers. I ran both the positive and negative wires to the front and grounded the body both at the motor and at the battery. The one aut fits perfect in the PVC pipe, you can get the wire at a local welding supply way cheaper than you can get from say Jeg's or summit. Hope this helps.||||reg||1
